### Harness-only probe corrections

- An initial accounting harness used the invalid unqualified model string
  `gpt-5`; the unchanged closed model validator rejected the fixture before the
  accounting code ran. The corrected `openai/gpt-5` fixture passed without a
  production edit.
- An initial artifact-store probe used the Windows system temporary directory,
  where the sandbox denied the hardened directory-handle operation. The exact
  temporary directory was removed, and the same provider-free probe passed in
  the authorized worktree. No production edit resulted.
- An optional `ruff format --check` was not used as an acceptance gate: the
  repository configuration explicitly enables Ruff lint only and the formatter
  proposed broad pre-existing reflow across all five large files. Required Ruff
  lint and the repository's commit hooks passed.

