calls, advanced an injected monotonic clock to verify absolute-wall reduction
and expiry, and checked exact command flag/value rendering. Static seam checks
confirmed the production live builder performs the same mapping and guards
evaluator work. It also rechecked legacy-route USD enforcement, optimizer USD
rejection, canonical/fail-closed accounting, schema-v3 summary output, absence
of active v2 aliases, and the sealed hidden path.

